  "difficulty": "complex",
  "description": "Create a real-photo field report snapshot from the cafe storefront image.",
  "instruction": "Create an 800x600 field report snapshot from the real cafe storefront photo. Complete it as a production workflow: place and crop the photo, apply the final color treatment, add the main information panel, add the accent strip, add the approval badge, add the headline 'FIELD UPDATE 023', add the detail 'RISK NOTES 023', add the owner/status line 'OWNER: ANALYST', and add the CTA 'FILE REPORT'.",
